draft.first_touch.IN.user_template:
Write a first-touch email to:
Name: {first_name} {last_name}
Role: {role_title} at {company_name}
Company summary: {company_summary}
Pain signal: {pain_signal}

Constraints:
- Subject 4-7 words, no emoji, no all-lowercase
- Body max 110 words, opens with 'Hi {first_name},'
- ONE specific reference to their company/work
- ONE sentence positioning what {{SENDER_NAME}} does
- ONE low-pressure ask (15-min chat, OK to decline)
- Close: 'Best,\n{{SENDER_NAME}}'

Return JSON {"subject", "body", "word_count"}.

